---
code: cli-unknown-flag
when-fires: an unrecognized flag with no near neighbour in the flag table. cli/lib.rs parse_args_from and parse_lint_args. {flag} is the token.
why: inv-top-reject in the small: an unmodeled flag is refused loudly rather than ignored, because a silently-dropped flag is a plan the admin did not ask for.
edit-loop: edit a sentence in the transcript below, then run `mise run loom:compile -- cli-unknown-flag && mise run loom:promote -- cli-unknown-flag`; prove it stuck with `mise run test`, which is also what catches anything else the promotion moved. `mise run loom:vars -- --all cli-unknown-flag` lists this case's values; type {{name}} to insert or move one.
---
-- replay --
$ dorc plan --boook=webhost.sh
dorc: error[cli-unknown-flag]: sm unknown flag `--boook=webhost.sh`
usage: dorc [probe|plan|apply] --book=<book.sh> [-o <oracle.sh>]... [--debug-argv]
